2467191},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! I can see:\n1. Farmers markets data has state-level data with a `farmers_markets` column\n2. Census data has `NAME` field for state names and `POPESTIMATE2025` for 2025 population\n\nI need to:\n1. Get the total farmers markets excluding territories from the farmers_markets table\n2. Get the 2025 population for \"United States\" from census_population table\n3. Calculate farmers markets per 100,000 residents\n\nTerritories would be places like Puerto Rico, Virgin Islands, Guam, etc. I need to exclude those. Let me first peek at what states are in the farmers markets data.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01B7xircZ9DFJuqRVAeSdk7L","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.select('state_name', 'state_abbr', 'farmers_markets').limit(60)","limit":0}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":293,"cacheRead":15572,"cacheWrite":1550,"totalTokens":17429,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.0014650000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0015572000000000001,"cacheWrite":0.0019375,"total":0.0049737},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":152},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912467192,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74oszuEXgS5w2y9M8BY","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01B7xircZ9DFJuqRVAeSdk7L","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\",\"state_abbr\",\"farmers_markets\"\n\"California\",\"CA\",647\n\"New York\",\"NY\",555\n\"Pennsylvania\",\"PA\",426\n\"Minnesota\",\"MN\",390\n\"Illinois\",\"IL\",370\n\"Virginia\",\"VA\",336\n\"Wisconsin\",\"WI\",335\n\"Michigan\",\"MI\",321\n\"Massachusetts\",\"MA\",273\n\"Florida\",\"FL\",246\n\"Georgia\",\"GA\",231\n\"Ohio\",\"OH\",219\n\"Texas\",\"TX\",216\n\"Missouri\",\"MO\",208\n\"North Carolina\",\"NC\",196\n\"Iowa\",\"IA\",194\n\"Kentucky\",\"KY\",183\n\"Indiana\",\"